      "content": "hey, i just got the most insane headache out of nowhere. like it hit me at full strength in like two seconds. it’s the worst pain i’ve ever felt but i get bad migraines a lot so i’m hoping it’s just a really bad one of those. is it normal for a migraine to hit that fast??",
